\strong{The columns read.} \code{mipca_flank_plan()} reads a column only if a window
can hold it, or if it is a target listed in \code{abb}, and refuses an \code{Inf} in
any column it reads. It does not read the other columns, so an \code{Inf} in one
of them is not refused. \code{mipca_flank()} reads only the targets listed in
