\item \code{"impute"}: fitted on its window.
\item \code{"clean"}: no missing values.
\item \code{"abb"}: listed in \code{abb}, and drawn from its own observed values.
\item \code{"inadmissible"}: constant, with fewer than two observed values, or missing
more than \code{colmax}. Its missing values stay \code{NA}.
\item \code{"window_small"}: fewer than \code{min_window_n} columns in its window. Its
